## User-specific configuration and secrets
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx

## Front end
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# .env is committed on purpose: it holds only the local API origin, and a VITE_
# variable ends up in the browser bundle anyway, so it can hold nothing secret.
# Personal overrides go in .env.local.
.env.local
.env.*.local

## Uploaded content (runtime data, not source)
wwwroot/Images/**/*
wwwroot/Files/**/*
!wwwroot/Images/**/.gitkeep
!wwwroot/Files/**/.gitkeep

